WEBVTT

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:01.219
Birds aren't real.

00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:04.055
It's a thing.

00:03:04.096 --> 00:03:05.306
(Laughter)

00:03:05.348 --> 00:03:08.643
Nuclear energy is bad.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.646
When it comes to nuclear power,

00:03:11.687 --> 00:03:14.899
the world has been sold a bad meme.

00:03:15.191 --> 00:03:16.484
An outdated one.

00:03:17.068 --> 00:03:18.736
Let's go back in time.

00:03:19.445 --> 00:03:24.325
It all started with the anti-nuclear
movement of the 1970s.

00:03:24.909 --> 00:03:28.037
The movement was driven in large part

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:30.665
by an understandable fear
of nuclear weapons.